Project AI Development Rules

This project follows strict architecture and coding rules.

Before generating code, always read:

docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
docs/AI_RULES.md

Follow the architecture and rules defined in those documents.

Key requirements:

- Do not create new folders unless necessary
- Place files in the correct architecture location
- Keep components small and modular
- Separate UI from business logic
- Follow the feature-based architecture

Architecture Source of Truth:
docs/ARCHITECTURE.md